    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 133 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Why I Respect Him)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I respect General Lee because he was able to prepare"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and execute great military victories."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He was always confident that his soldiers would be successful"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "in battle. He was very brave and not afraid to die."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "To General Lee, duty and responsibility were very important."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "One day, I hope to grow up to be as brave and confident"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "as General Soon-Shin Lee."
    },
